# Goose Fire Ceramics — environment variables
#
# THIS SITE IS FULLY STATIC. Nothing here is required to build or deploy it.
# These placeholders exist for when the forms are connected to real providers.
# Do NOT put real secrets in a file that gets committed — if a provider ever
# issues you a key, set it in the Vercel dashboard, never in this file.

# Where the contact form should POST. Not configured yet — the form is disabled.
# CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://form.goosefire.shop/inquiry

# Where the newsletter signup should POST. Not configured yet — disabled.
# NEWSLETTER_ENDPOINT=https://buttondown.email/api/emails/embed-subscribe/YOUR-LIST
